This product includes no third-party code: it is built only with the Go standard library.

Vulnerability data is NOT bundled. When the user supplies OSV dumps with
--vulndb, reports quote advisory identifiers and summaries from OSV.dev
(https://osv.dev) and link to each advisory. OSV data is published by its
upstream sources under their own licenses (for example CC-BY 4.0); users are
responsible for complying with them. The files in examples/demo-vulndb are
synthetic and contain no real advisory.
